{"slug":"e-y-sh","ar":"ع ي ش","total":8,"core":"living; livelihood","forms":[{"ar":"مَعِيشَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"life, livelihood","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":124,"p":7,"ar":["وَمَنْ","أَعْرَضَ","عَن","ذِكْرِى","فَإِنَّ","لَهُۥ","مَعِيشَةً","ضَنكًا","وَنَحْشُرُهُۥ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","أَعْمَىٰ"],"en":"And whoever turns away from My remembrance - indeed, he will have a depressed life, and We will gather him on the Day of Resurrection blind"}},{"ar":"عِيشَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"life","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":21,"p":3,"ar":["فَهُوَ","فِى","عِيشَةٍ","رَّاضِيَةٍ"],"en":"So he will be in a pleasant life"}},{"ar":"مَعَٰيِش","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"means of living","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":20,"p":4,"ar":["وَجَعَلْنَا","لَكُمْ","فِيهَا","مَعَـٰيِشَ","وَمَن","لَّسْتُمْ","لَهُۥ","بِرَٰزِقِينَ"],"en":"And We have made for you therein means of living and [for] those for whom you are not providers"}},{"ar":"مَعَاش","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"livelihood","word":null,"ex":{"s":78,"a":11,"p":3,"ar":["وَجَعَلْنَا","ٱلنَّهَارَ","مَعَاشًا"],"en":"And made the day for livelihood"}}],"surahs":[[7,1],[15,1],[20,1],[28,1],[43,1],[69,1],[78,1],[101,1]]}